<title>GERMANY: Siemens' Osram seeks 20 pct sales rise.</title>
<headline>Siemens' Osram seeks 20 pct sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Osram GmbH, the lighting unit of Germany's Siemens AG, said on Tuesday it expected sales to rise about 20 percent over the next three years, reaching seven billion marks in 2000.</p>
<p>The unit, which had sales of 5.7 billion marks in the year ended September 30, also said profit would rise at about the same rate. Net profit rose 17 percent to 262 million marks in 1995-96.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
